\section*{Data/Software/Code Availability}
All figures and results are reproducible using the evidence bundle in
\path{catalog/evidence/} (archived as \texttt{echo\_equation\_evidence\_bundle\_v1.zip}).
Each figure is accompanied by a provenance JSON listing its code source, input CSVs, and SHA-256 integrity hashes.
The bundle also includes guard metrics and a reproducibility README for referees.
